{
  "text": "# Returns and refunds\nUnopened equipment can be returned within 30 days of delivery. A receipt or order number is required. Opened equipment is eligible only if it is faulty. Refunds use the original payment method and take 5 to 10 business days after inspection.\n\n# Exceptions\nCustom engraved equipment cannot be returned unless faulty. Subscription renewals are covered by a separate cancellation policy. Contact support before shipping a battery because transport restrictions apply.\n\n# Delivery\nStandard delivery takes 3 to 5 business days. Express delivery takes 1 to 2 business days. Delivery estimates start after dispatch, not when an order is placed. A tracking email is sent when the package leaves the warehouse.\n\n# Warranty\nThe Trail 200 and Trail 400 have a two-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Proof of purchase is required. Accidental damage, water immersion and ordinary wear are excluded. Replacement parts retain the original warranty end date.",
